---
title: Matcha Smoothie
servings: 1
time required: 5 minutes
course: Drink
cuisine: American
---

Blend together @matcha powder{2-3 tbsp}(generally to taste by strength of matcha), @bananas{2}(frozen), @milk{1%cup}, @vanilla extract{splash}, @ice{1-2%handful}, @honey{1%tbsp}, and @?vanilla protein powder{1%scoop} until smooth.

> You can alternatively replace the ice with 1 cup vanilla yogurt, if you ahve it on hand.